.png" id="ematt:269" style="font-family:&quot;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:34px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none;line-height:3;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/853d1617764151.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-07 上午10.55.18 (1).png" border="0" width="1004" height="726"/></a><br/><span style="font-family:&quot;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:34px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none;line-height:3;"><strong>[破解]</strong></span><br style="font-family:&quot;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:34px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none;line-height:3;"/><span style="font-family:&quot;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:34px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none;line-height:3;">将破解补丁复制到本文件安装目录，双击破解补丁，释放所有补丁即可<br/><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/581e1617764504.png" id="ematt:271" style="font-family:&quot;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:34px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none;line-height:3;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/581e1617764504.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-07 上午11.00.16 (1).png" border="0" width="1602" height="1142"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/24cc1617764588.png" id="ematt:273" style="font-family:&quot;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:34px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none;line-height:3;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/24cc1617764588.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-07 上午11.02.40 (1).png" border="0" width="650" height="726"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/d9f51617764703.png" id="ematt:275"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/d9f51617764703.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-07 上午11.04.18 (1).png" border="0" width="1602" height="1204"/></a><br/></span></span></span></p>','在windows安装流星TV并破解，观看全国电视节目','tv,流星网络电视','soft','0','','1',658,NULL),(66,NULL,NULL,'MAC安装Davinci Resolve Studio 17中文破解版','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><strong style="font-family: 黑体, SimHei;"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/e5ee1619019722.png" id="ematt:277"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/e5ee1619019722.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="D-1 (1).png" border="0" width="600" height="300"/></a></strong><br/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: 黑体, SimHei;"><span style="font-family: 黑体, SimHei; line-height: 3; font-size: 14px;"><strong>[介绍]</strong></span><br/><span style="font-family: 黑体, SimHei; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-size: 14px;"></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3;">达芬奇(DaVinci Resolve Studio) for Mac是macOS上的一款十分热门且专业的</span></span><a href="http://www.32r.com/zt/245.html" style="cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-size: 14px; font-family: 黑体, SimHei;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-size: 14px; font-family: 黑体, SimHei;">视频编辑</span></a><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: 黑体, SimHei;">软件，同时该款软件也是迄今最先进的调色工具和专业多轨道音</span><a href="http://www.32r.com/zt/spjjrj/" style="cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-size: 14px; font-family: 黑体, SimHei;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-size: 14px; font-family: 黑体, SimHei;">视频剪辑</span></a><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: 黑体, SimHei;">工具。功能上软件就为用户们提供了调色、色彩管理、离线编辑精编、视觉特效、音频处理等在内的多方面服务能力，而通过该款软你可完成剪辑、调色、后期及交付绝大部分工作。至于在应用领域方面，达芬奇17 Mac也是相当广泛的哦，例如电影、电视剧、广告、独立电影、音乐电视等方面都是可以看到该软件的踪迹的，可以说相当的广泛。<br/><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/e5ee1619019722.png" id="ematt:277" style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:14px;white-space:normal;"></a><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; line-height: 3;"><strong>[新增功能]</strong><br/>而与上一代产品相比呢，这一点产品在许多地方有着十分明显的增强，例如新一代HDR调色工具，它可以为你提供了能创建新的色轮，带有特定色调范围的自定义过渡功能，为您提供更有创意的控制和细致的调整；而新检视器划像模式包含着新增对角线、百叶窗、棋盘格式划像，该监视器的改进使得用户们现在可以从不同的方式对比画面，提供额外的灵活度，非常适合对比多个片段，或者用来对比同个片段中的不同视频帧等等</span><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/fa0a1619020037.png" id="ematt:279"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/fa0a1619020037.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-21 下午11.46.40 (1).png" border="0" width="978" height="514"/></a><br/><strong style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:14px;white-space:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;">[系统版本]</strong><br style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:14px;white-space:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"/>MAC OS 10.15.7(BIG SUR没测试，破解不失效即可)<a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/d4de1619020230.png" id="ematt:281"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/d4de1619020230.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-21 下午11.49.09 (1).png" border="0" width="1176" height="662"/></a><br/><strong style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:14px;white-space:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;">[软件版本]</strong><br style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:14px;white-space:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"/><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Davinci Resolve Studio 17.1.1 For Mac中文破解版</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 18px; font-family: Titillium, 微软雅黑, Arial, 黑体, 宋体, sans-serif;"></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: &quot;font-size:18px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;padding:10px;line-height:1.6;overflow:auto;background:#F6F6F6;border-radius:3px;overflow-wrap:normal;border:1px solid #DDDDDD;color:#333333;&quot;;"></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: &quot;font-size:14px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;padding:10px;line-height:1.6;overflow:auto;background:#F6F6F6;border-radius:3px;overflow-wrap:normal;border:1px solid #DDDDDD;color:#333333;&quot;;"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:14px;white-space:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;">[安装破解]</strong><br style="font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:14px;white-space:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"/><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">1、下载安装包，双击install图标<a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/f3671619020746.png" id="ematt:283"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/f3671619020746.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-21 下午11.55.12 (1).png" border="0" width="962" height="1310"/></a><br/>2、安装结束后，打开会提示输入激活码，关闭程序<a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/95c41619022658.png" id="ematt:291"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/95c41619022658.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-22 上午12.05.56 (1) (1).png" border="0" width="1786" height="928"/></a><br/>3、复制安装包内Resolve到软件安装包内替换即可<br/><span style="line-height: 3; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Titillium, 微软雅黑, Arial, 黑体, 宋体, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">路径：/Applications/DaVinci Resolve/DaVinci Resolve.app/Contents/MacOS<a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/080b1619021322.png" id="ematt:285"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/080b1619021322.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-21 下午11.58.06 (1).png" border="0" width="1218" height="590"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/e7b01619021381.png" id="ematt:287"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/e7b01619021381.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-22 上午12.03.58 (1).png" border="0" width="920" height="464"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202104/74fc1619021436.png" id="ematt:289"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202104/74fc1619021436.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-04-22 上午12.04.05 (1).png" border="0" width="666" height="284"/></a><br/></span></span><strong>[异常处理]</strong><br/>1、<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: 黑体, SimHei; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">应用显示不能打开请参考以下方法</span><br/><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Titillium, 微软雅黑, Arial, 黑体, 宋体, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">打开终端，输入&nbsp;</span></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;padding:10px;line-height:1.6;overflow:auto;background:#F6F6F6;border-radius:3px;overflow-wrap:normal;border:1px solid #DDDDDD;color:#333333;&quot;;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: 黑体, SimHei; color: rgb(229, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;">xcode-select --install</span><br/><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 3; font-family: Titillium, 微软雅黑, Arial, 黑体, 宋体, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;">回车，然后输入以下代码回车</span><br/><span style="font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: 黑体, SimHei; color: rgb(229, 51, 51);"></span></span><span style="font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 3; font-family: 黑体, SimHei; color: rgb(229, 51, 51);">sudo codesign -f -s - /Applications/DaVinci Resolve/DaVinci Resolve.app/Contents/MacOS/Resolve</span><br/></span> </p>','在MAC安装DavinciResolveStudio17破解版','mac,DavinciResolveStudio,达芬奇,调色','soft','0','','1',1299,NULL),(68,NULL,NULL,'dilicms3.0-通用mysql数据库管理系统','','','','<p><br/></p><p><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/a8b11631803110.png" id="ematt:293"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/a8b11631803110.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="D-1.png" border="0" width="800" height="300"/></a><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2.5;"></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"><strong>[前言]<br/></strong></span></span><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"></span><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2.5;"> dilicms3.0是一款通用mysql数据库管理系统，在此系统，您可以快速建立模块、表单、字段，拥有完整的权限管理系统，原本这款cms项目已不再更新，笔者在开发过程中，支持了php7+，并添加了模块等功能，修复了若干bug</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;line-height:3;&quot;;"><span style="line-height:2.5;"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/bbd51631804866.png" id="ematt:309"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/bbd51631804866.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="点击查看原图" border="0" width="800" height="480" vspace="0"/></a></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;line-height:2.5;&quot;;"><strong><br/></strong></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;line-height:2.5;&quot;;"><strong>[功能]</strong></span><br/></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2.5;">-后台、站点信息设置</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><br/></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2.5;"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/cde01631804350.png" id="ematt:295"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/cde01631804350.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="点击查看原图" border="0" width="800" height="500" vspace="0"/></a></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2;"><span style="line-height:2.5;"><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2;"><span style="line-height:2.5;">-用户组、用户管理，并对每个用户组进行每个模块、每个表单，增删改查权限管理</span></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2;"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2;"><span style="line-height:2.5;"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/3f531631804795.png" id="ematt:307"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/3f531631804795.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="点击查看原图" border="0" width="800" height="371" vspace="0"/></a></span></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:&quot;line-height:3;"><span style="line-height:2;"><span style="line-height:2.5;">-表单模块、表单字段、增删改查，快速建模块，建表，实例化表单组件<a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/f3651631804435.png" id="ematt:297"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/f3651631804435.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-16 下午11.00.01 (1).png" border="0" width="1958" height="1132"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/ad7a1631804506.png" id="ematt:299"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/ad7a1631804506.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-16 下午11.01.14 (1).png" border="0" width="2880" height="1152"/></a></span></span><span style="line-height:2;"><span style="line-height:2.5;"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/87831631804595.png" id="ematt:301"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/87831631804595.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-16 下午11.02.47 (1).png" border="0" width="2880" height="1124"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/48521631804670.png" id="ematt:303"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/48521631804670.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-16 下午11.04.06 (1).png" border="0" width="2078" height="1164"/></a>-数据库备份、还原<a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/67161631804724.png" id="ematt:305"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202109/67161631804724.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-16 下午11.04.58 (1).png" border="0" width="1656" height="1162"/></a></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"><strong>[环境]<br/></strong></span><span style="line-height:2.5;">-php5.6-php7.2<br/>-</span><span style="line-height:2.5;">apache/nginx<br/>-</span><span style="line-height:2.5;">mysql5.4-mysql5.7<br/></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"><strong>[日志]<br/></strong></span><span style="line-height:2.5;">*</span><span style="caret-color:#000000;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:13.3333px;text-size-adjust:auto;line-height:2.5;">去除apache服务器下，路由中的index.php<br/></span><span style="line-height:2.5;">*解决代码在php7.2部分bug<br/></span><span style="line-height:2.5;">*增加模块增删改查<br/></span><span style="line-height:2.5;">*增加字段标识默认长度<br/></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"></span><span style="line-height:2.5;"><strong>[仓库]<br/></strong></span><a href="https://github.com/huyouqiang/dilicms3.0.git" target="_blank" title="https://github.com/huyouqiang/dilicms3.0.git">https://github.com/huyouqiang/dilicms3.0.git</a><br/><span style="line-height:2.5;"></span></span></span></p>','dilicms3.0是一款通用mysql数据库管理系统，在此系统，您可以快速建立模块、表单、字段，拥有完整的权限管理系统','dilicms,mysql,cms,database','dev','0','','1',887,NULL),(70,NULL,NULL,'mamp-php开发集成环境(mac)','','','','<p style="text-align:center"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/a0761631886920.png" id="ematt:317"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20220311/1647004020100335.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="点击查看原图" border="0" width="800" height="300" vspace="0"/></a></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin:0pt 0pt 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt;white-space:normal;"><span style="line-height:3;"><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:3;">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:3;">[前言]</span></strong></span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;"> 和win版本wamp一样，mac也有自己的php集成环境，mamp集成了开发所需要的功能，比起使用homebrew，免受外网龟速下载的痛苦，实现快速部署，图形化方便操作配置</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;"> <strong><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:3;">[</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:3;">功能]</span></strong></span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;"> -apache</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;"> -nginx</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;"> -php5-8</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;"> -redis</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;"> -memcache</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;">-mysql</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;">-vhost</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;">-python</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;"> -perl</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;font-size:14px;">-ruby</span><br/><span style="line-height:3;"><strong><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:3;"> [预览]</span></strong></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin:0pt 0pt 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt;white-space:normal;"><br/></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin:0pt 0pt 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt;white-space:normal;"><strong style="font-size: 10.5pt;"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/07681631888244.png" id="ematt:321"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20220311/1647004022821928.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-17 下午10.15.31.png" border="0" width="800" height="500"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/3d361631888250.png" id="ematt:323"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20220311/1647004024102355.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-17 下午10.15.44.png" border="0" width="800" height="500"/></a></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin:0pt 0pt 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt;white-space:normal;"><br/></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin:0pt 0pt 0.0001pt;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt;white-space:normal;"><strong style="font-size: 10.5pt;"><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/ceaa1631888256.png" id="ematt:325"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20220311/1647004024130552.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-17 下午10.15.53.png" border="0" width="800" height="500"/></a><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/0d8f1631888262.png" id="ematt:327"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20220311/1647004025127148.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="截屏2021-09-17 下午10.16.02.png" border="0" width="800" height="500"/></a></strong><br/></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;font-size:14px;line-height:3;"></span><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:3;"> <strong>[下载]</strong></span><br/>精品MAC应用分享</p><p><a href="https://xclient.info/s/mamp-pro.html#versions" target="_blank" style="white-space: normal;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 3;">https://xclient.info/s/mamp-pro.html#versions</span></a><br/><a target="_blank" href="/upload/202109/9dae1631888488.png" id="ematt:329"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20220311/1647004026683130.png" title="点击查看原图" alt="点击查看原图" border="0" width="800" height="500" vspace="0"/></a></p>','在macos安装mamp，即可快速搭建php集成环境，包括apache/nginx/php5/php7/php8/mysql/redis/memcache等','mamp,php,集成环境,mac','dev','0','','1',1231,NULL),(71,NULL,NULL,'DJI MINI 2开箱测评','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/202112/e5ee1638528571.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/202112/e5ee1638528571.png"></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>11.24在某平台入手<code>DJI MINI 2</code>，拿来配合SONY A6400配合拍摄，补全航拍设备空缺，遂记录一下，录一期开箱测评\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[清单]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>\n<code>\n-DJI MINI 2       x1<br/>\n-遥控器              x1<br/>\n-电池                 x1<br/>\n-备用螺旋桨      x4<br/>\n-备用数据线      x2<br/>\n-螺丝刀             x1<br/>\n</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[视频]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<iframe height="300" width="80%" src="https://player.youku.com/embed/XNTgyNDc0Njg5Ng==" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" style="font-family:&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:normal;">\t</iframe>\n</p>','11.24在某平台入手DJIMINI2，拿来配合SONYA6400配合拍摄，补全航拍设备空缺，遂记录一下，录一期开箱测评'