-size: 14px;">1、CleanMyMac X 不会放过 macOS 中的任何垃圾，帮助您清理不需要的文件、过期的缓存、损坏的下载文件、日志和没有用的位置信息。您可以删除 iTunes、邮件、照片中的隐藏的大量垃圾，甚至锁定隐藏的大型文件。CleanMyMac X 中的 Mac 清理工具将在数秒内让您的 Mac 轻装运行。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="https://cdn.cleanmymac.cn/images/features/cleaning-v2@2x.14384b4fc1d45ba2cb31.webp" style="box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; "/></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">2、每次 Mac 运行缓慢时，您都会用到一整套加速工具：释放 RAM、运行维护脚本、管理登录项目、启动代理和挂起应用。这样可以减轻系统负载，并最大程度上调优 Mac 性能。 Mac 运行性能提升的同时，您也可以高效地工作。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="https://cdn.cleanmymac.cn/images/features/speed-v2@2x.139b8ed650bfc31dfa49.webp" style="box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; "/></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">3、您的 Mac 上是否有病毒。如果您尝试使用 CleanMyMac X 清理 Mac，那么您不会面临这个问题。CleanMyMac X 可以防御针对 macOS 的恶意软件、广告软件、勒索软件以及其他类型的软件。一旦发现问题，它会立即将其删除。我们会定期更新恶意软件数据库，CleanMyMac X 的保护模块让您始终可以高枕无忧。<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"/></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="https://cdn.cleanmymac.cn/images/features/protection-v2@2x.714711cb190fc19dc654.webp" style="box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none;"/></span></p><p><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">4、<span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; white-space: pre-wrap;">CleanMyMac X 可以让您的 Mac 更有序地运行，同时为您提供优秀的卸载器和更新程序。卸载器可以完全移除不需要的应用，更新程序可以立即更新您的所有软件。新旧软件无缝衔接。这样可以帮助您解决软件冲突，让您的 Mac 始终迅捷如新。</span></span></p><p><img class="rounded" src="https://cdn.cleanmymac.cn/images/features/app_management-v2@2x.0c3ad3fe8bf524b0219d.webp" style="white-space: normal; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none;"/></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[视频]</span></p><video width="100%" height="auto" controls=""><source src="https://cdn.cleanmymac.cn/video/main_topper_new.d61ce695c7d595a33683.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[功能]</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">1、官网地址</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><a href="https://www.cleanmymac.cn/" target="_blank" title="https://www.cleanmymac.cn/">https://www.cleanmymac.cn/</a></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">2、tnt破解版</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><a href="http://wm.makeding.com/iclk/?zoneid=32210" target="_blank" title="http://wm.makeding.com/iclk/?zoneid=32210">http://wm.makeding.com/iclk/?zoneid=32210</a></span></p>','CleanMyMac X是一款专业的Mac清理软件，可智能清理mac磁盘垃圾和多余语言安装包，快速释放电脑内存，轻松管理和升级Mac上的应用。同时CleanMyMac X可以强力卸载恶意软件，修复系统漏洞，一键扫描和优化Mac系统，让您的电脑焕然一新！','clean,mac,anti-virus,soft','soft','0','','1',1077,NULL),(169,NULL,NULL,'斯坦福大学多语言词性标注器','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230408/1680884629128510.png" title="1680884629128510.png" alt="1680884629128510.png" width="800" height="400" border="0" vspace="0"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><strong style="font-size: 14px;">[前言]</strong><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span>词性标注器 (POS Tagger) 是一种软件，可以读取某种语言的文本并将词性分配给每个单词（和其他标记），例如名词、动词、形容词等，来源于斯坦福大学预言研究组，且研究多年<span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[语言]</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">PHP/JAVA/Python/C#等<br/></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230408/1680883447817671.png" title="1680883447817671.png" alt="截屏2023-04-08 00.03.34-tuya.png"/></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[环境]</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">该系统需要安装 Java 8+。根据您运行的是 32 位还是 64 位 Java 以及标记器模型的复杂性，您将需要 60 到 200 MB 的内存来运行经过训练的标记器（即，您可能需要为 Java 提供一个选项，例如java -mx200m） . 训练标注器需要大量内存。这又取决于模型的复杂性，但通常至少需要 1GB，通常更多。</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[官网]</span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><a href="https://nlp.stanford.edu/software/tagger.shtml#Download" target="_blank" title="https://nlp.stanford.edu/software/tagger.shtml#Download" style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">https://nlp.stanford.edu/software/tagger.shtml#Download</span></a></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[示例]</span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">这里以PHP版本为例：</span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230408/1680883991515193.png" title="1680883991515193.png" alt="截屏2023-04-08 00.12.53.png"/></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">输出结果：</span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230408/1680884054869432.png" title="1680884054869432.png" alt="截屏2023-04-08 00.13.57.png"/></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[仓库]</span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">官方仓库</span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><a href="https://github.com/patrickschur/stanford-nlp-tagger" target="_blank" title="https://github.com/patrickschur/stanford-nlp-tagger">https://github.com/patrickschur/stanford-nlp-tagger</a></span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">个人demo-PHP版本</span></p><p style="white-space: normal; line-height: 2em;"><a href="https://github.com/huyouqiang/stanford-nlp-tagger-php" target="_blank" title="https://github.com/huyouqiang/stanford-nlp-tagger-php" textvalue="https://github.com/huyouqiang/stanford-nlp-tagger-php" style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">https://github.com/huyouqiang/stanford-nlp-tagger-php</span></a></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p>','词性标注器 (POS Tagger) 是一种软件，可以读取某种语言的文本并将词性分配给每个单词（和其他标记），例如名词、动词、形容词等，来源于斯坦福大学预言研究组，且研究多年','php,java,stanford,postagger','dev','0','','1',864,NULL),(172,NULL,NULL,'关于m2芯片兼容性','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230628/1687927460970184.jpg" title="1687927460970184.jpg" alt="1687927460970184.jpg" width="997" height="590" border="0" vspace="0"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><strong style="font-size: 14px;">[前言]</strong><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span>前几天购买了m2 macbook air，测试了一下软件的兼容性，测试内容包括：homebrew/虚拟机/编程/图形处理，总结来说，常规开发流程没问题，但也存在一些兼容性问题<span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[平台]</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">MAC OS 13</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[时间]</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">2023.06.27</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[结果]</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230628/1687927690350744.png" title="1687927690350744.png" alt="m2软件兼容列表副本.png"/><span style="font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">[链接]</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">分享一些查询Apple Silicon软件适配的网站</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><a href="https://formulae.brew.sh/" target="_blank" title="homebrew兼容性查询">homebrew兼容性查询</a><br/></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><a href="https://doesitarm.com/kind/app/2" target="_blank" title="mac app/homebrew兼容性查询" style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light;">mac app/homebrew兼容性查询</span></a><br/></p>','前几天购买了m2 macbook air，测试了一下软件的兼容性，测试内容包括：homebrew/虚拟机/编程/图形处理，总结来说，常规开发流程没问题，但也存在一些兼容性问题','m chip,macbook air,soft,arm','microchip','0','','1',1150,NULL),(178,NULL,NULL,'markdown基本使用和总结','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230711/1689026543558953.png" title="1689026543558953.png" alt="1689026543558953.png" width="800" height="400" border="0" vspace="0"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="font-size: 14px;">[前言]</strong><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span>Markdown 是一种轻量级标记语言，创始人为约翰·格鲁伯（John Gruber）。 它允许人们使用易读易写的纯文本格式编写文档，然后转换成有效的 XHTML（或者HTML）文档。这种语言吸收了很多在电子邮件中已有的纯文本标记的特性。<span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[优点]</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1、简洁易学：Markdown语法简单明了，容易学习和使用，即使没有编程经验也能快速上手。只需掌握几个基本语法，就可以开始写作和编辑文本。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">2、高效可读性：由于Markdown语法简洁明了，不会让人分心，因此在写作过程中更高效。同时，Markdown语言支持实时预览，在编写笔记时能够方便地查看最终的呈现效果，避免不必要的错误和调整。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">3、多平台兼容：Markdown可以用于各种平台，例如Windows、MacOS、Linux等。而且不需要特殊的软件支持，只要有一个文本编辑器就可以开始写作。Markdown还支持导出为多种格式，如HTML、PDF等。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">4、方便管理：由于Markdown是纯文本格式，因此文件大小很小，方便存储和管理。同时，Markdown文件易于版本控制，适合团队协作。许多笔记软件也提供了Markdown的支持，能够将Markdown文件直接导入或导出，使得笔记整理更加方便。</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[缺点]</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1、不适合复杂的编辑，如表格、图片、排版、换行</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">2、输入方式单一，只有键盘文字。没有语音，图片，视频，手写，语音转换文字，手写文字混合</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">3、不支持携带图片，视频，需要网盘平台</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">4、文件和文件之间没有双链</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">5、各个平台对不同版本的markdown支持不一样</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-weight: bolder; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[语法]</span></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><a href="http://markdown.p2hp.com/" target="_blank" title="http://markdown.p2hp.com/" style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">http://markdown.p2hp.com/</span></a><br/></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-weight: bolder; font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230711/1689027460996787.png" title="1689027460996787.png" alt="截屏2023-07-11 06.14.25.png"/></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-weight: bolder; font-size: 14px;">[软件]<br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">1、typora</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><a href="https://www.torrentmac.net/wp-content/uploads/tr_files/2023/Typora_1.5.13_Torrentmac.net.dmg.torrent" target="_blank" title="https://www.torrentmac.net/wp-content/uploads/tr_files/2023/Typora_1.5.13_Torrentmac.net.dmg.torrent" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">https://www.torrentmac.net/wp-content/uploads/tr_files/2023/Typora_1.5.13_Torrentmac.net.dmg.torrent</span></a><br/></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">2、vs code</span></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/" target="_blank" title="https://code.visualstudio.com/" textvalue="https://code.visualstudio.com/" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">https://code.visualstudio.com/</span></a></p>','Markdown 是一种轻量级标记语言，创始人为约翰·格鲁伯（John Gruber）。 它允许人们使用易读易写的纯文本格式编写文档，然后转换成有效的 XHTML（或者HTML）文档。这种语言吸收了很多在电子邮件中已有的纯文本标记的特性。','markdown,word,html,typora','dev','0','','1',1507,NULL),(179,NULL,NULL,'homebrew安装mysql5.7','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230713/1689182020571432.png" title="1689182020571432.png" alt="1689182020571432.png" width="800" height="400" border="0" vspace="0"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="font-size: 14px;">[前言]</strong><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span>MySQL是一个关系型数据库管理系统，由瑞典MySQL AB 公司开发，属于 Oracle 旗下产品。MySQL 是最流行的关系型数据库管理系统之一，在 WEB 应用方面，MySQL是最好的 RDBMS (Relational Database Management System，关系数据库管理系统) 应用软件之一。<span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[安装]</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1、基于homebrew安装包依赖管理工具，首先查找mysql</span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">brew&nbsp;search&nbsp;mysql<br/></span></p></pre><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230713/1689182381488300.png" title="1689182381488300.png" alt="截屏2023-07-13 01.19.07.png"/><span style="font-size: 14px;">2、输入命令，安装mysql@5.7<br/></span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">brew&nbsp;install&nbsp;mysql@5.7<br/></span></p></pre><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">3、安装完成之后，提醒你是否需要临时密码，还有将mysql添加为第一环境变量</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230713/1689182977966971.png" title="1689182977966971.png" alt="am46y-dz2bl副本 (1).png"/>4、启动mysql@5.7，这里我已安装完毕，所以使用restart重启mysql@5.7</span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">brew&nbsp;services&nbsp;start&nbsp;mysql@5.7<br/></span></p></pre><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230713/1689183205125832.png" title="1689183205125832.png" alt="截屏2023-07-13 01.32.43.png"/><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><br/></span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">5、登录mysql，该版本为无密码安装，输入密码步骤，回车即可</span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">mysql&nbsp;-u&nbsp;root&nbsp;-p<br/></span></p></pre><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230713/1689183345998848.png" title="1689183345998848.png" alt="截屏2023-07-13 01.35.34.png"/></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">6、修改localhost@root密码，并刷新，即刻生效</span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">ALTER&nbsp;USER&nbsp;&#39;用户名&#39;@&#39;localhost&#39;&nbsp;IDENTIFIED&nbsp;WITH&nbsp;mysql_native_password&nbsp;BY&nbsp;&#39;新密码&#39;;<br/></span></p></pre><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">flush privileges; &nbsp; --刷新MySQL的系统权限相关表<br/></span></p></pre><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[总结]</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">基于homebrew安装管理工具，安装mysql等服务很方便，但homebrew的软件库，会有低版本不给安装问题，遇到此问题，可以添加第三方包，再次安装即可</span></p>','MySQL是一个关系型数据库管理系统，由瑞典MySQL AB 公司开发，属于 Oracle 旗下产品。MySQL 是最流行的关系型数据库管理系统之一，在 WEB 应用方面，MySQL是最好的 RDBMS (Relational Database Management System，关系数据库管理系统) 应用软件之一。','mysql,homebrew,sql,database','dev','0','','1',652,NULL),(181,NULL,NULL,'js实现图片懒加载','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230713/1689199132704116.png" title="1689199132704116.png" alt="1689199132704116.png" width="800" height="400" border="0" vspace="0"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="font-size: 14px;">[前言]</strong><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">对于一些需要展示大量图片的网站，一次性加载，需要等待很长时间，<span style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">有一种常用的解决方式是：随着滚动动态加载，即图片的惰性加载。视图之外的图片默认不加载，随着页面的滚动，图片进入了显示的范围，则触发图片的加载显示</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 14px;">[安装]</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1、下载jquery.lazyload.js，并引入项目中去</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><a href="http://lib.h-ui.net/lazyload/1.9.3/lazyload.js" target="_blank" title="http://lib.h-ui.net/lazyload/1.9.3/lazyload.js">http://lib.h-ui.net/lazyload/1.9.3/lazyload.js</a><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">2、将图片的真实路径放在img的data-original属性上。给img标签增加一个自定义的类名如：lazyload，方便js调用</span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">&lt;img&nbsp;class=&quot;lazyload&quot;&nbsp;src=&quot;默认loading图片&quot;&nbsp;width=&quot;1000&quot;&nbsp;height=&quot;60&quot;&nbsp;data-original=&quot;//images.h-ui.net/www/AD-1000x60.gif&quot;&nbsp;/&gt;<br/></span></p></pre><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">3、js代码</span></p><pre class="brush:bash;toolbar:false"><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">$(function(){$(&quot;img.lazyload&quot;).lazyload();});<br/></span></p></pre><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">4、<span style="font-size: 14px; text-wrap: wrap;">jquery.lazyload.js还有很多额外参数，具体功能如下</span></span><br/><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230715/1689365314520816.png" title="1689365314520816.png" alt="截屏2023-07-15 04.05.49副本.png"/></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">5、示例效果如下</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/lazyload.gif" style="max-width:350px;"/></p>','对于一些需要展示大量图片的网站，一次性加载，需要等待很长时间，有一种常用的解决方式是：随着滚动动态加载，即图片的惰性加载。视图之外的图片默认不加载，随着页面的滚动，图片进入了显示的范围，则触发图片的加载显示','js,lazyload,img,html','dev','0','','1',1520,NULL),(190,NULL,NULL,'codeigniter4实现php-redis队列','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689971723187595.png" title="1689971723187595.png" alt="1689971723187595.png" width="800" height="400" border="0" vspace="0"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="font-size: 14px;">[前言]</strong><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">codeigniter4对于redis的封装，比较简单，只有简单的键值对，开发过程中，难免要用到redis队列功能，本文介绍如何在<span style="font-size: 14px; text-wrap: wrap;">codeigniter4项目中，集成redis queue功能</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 14px;">[安装]</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1、因为ci4对于redis的封装仅限于键值对，所以下载第三方redis操作类至app/Libraries文件夹内，命名为myRedis</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689972053573544.png" title="1689972053573544.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 04.40.36.png"/><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689972195184692.png" title="1689972195184692.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 04.42.23.png"/><span style="font-size: 14px;">2、项目内控制器都继承BaseController，所以将第三方myRedis链接，放置<span style="font-size: 14px; text-wrap: wrap;">BaseController构造函数内</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689972455284218.png" title="1689972455284218.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 04.45.53.png"/><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">3、新建Queue控制器，书写push入队列和pop出队列方法</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689972853690992.png" title="1689972853690992.png" alt="7.png"/>4、确认已安装好supervisor守护进程软件，编写queue-pop.ini配置文件，放置/etc/supervisord.d配置文件夹下</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689973349590161.png" title="1689973349590161.png" alt="8.png"/></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">5、重新载入supervisor配置文件，去浏览器访问your-server-ip:9001，在supervisor图形界面就能看到queue-pop进程</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689973826412373.png" title="1689973826412373.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 05.07.58.png"/></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">6、浏览器访问your-server-name/queue/push入队列方法</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689973913231410.png" title="1689973913231410.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 05.11.38.png"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;">7、利用redis图形工具查看redis占用内存和redis队列数据</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689974080426780.png" title="1689974080426780.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 05.13.18.png"/><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689974090359151.png" title="1689974090359151.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 05.13.37.png"/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;">8、利用nacicat，查看数据库写入情况</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689974543505789.png" title="1689974543505789.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 05.22.10.png"/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;"><br/></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-weight: bolder; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;">[附件]</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1、github仓库</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><a href="https://github.com/huyouqiang/CodeIgniter4-Redis-Queue" target="_blank" title="https://github.com/huyouqiang/CodeIgniter4-Redis-Queue">https://github.com/huyouqiang/CodeIgniter4-Redis-Queue</a><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"></span></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">2、codeigniter4 cli运行文档</span></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><a href="https://codeigniter.org.cn/user_guide/cli/cli.html" target="_blank" title="https://codeigniter.org.cn/user_guide/cli/cli.html" textvalue="https://codeigniter.org.cn/user_guide/cli/cli.html" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">https://codeigniter.org.cn/user_guide/cli/cli.html</span></a></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">3、supervisor文档</span></p><p style="text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2em;"><a href="http://supervisord.org/introduction.html" target="_blank" title="http://supervisord.org/introduction.html" textvalue="http://supervisord.org/introduction.html" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">http://supervisord.org/introduction.html</span></a></p>','codeigniter4对于redis的封装，比较简单，只有简单的键值对，开发过程中，难免要用到redis队列功能，本文介绍如何在codeigniter4项目中，集成redis queue功能','codeigniter4,php,supervisor,redis','dev','0','','1',1039,NULL),(191,NULL,NULL,'mysql索引优化之普通索引','','','','<p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689986188300659.png" title="1689986188300659.png" alt="1689986188300659.png" width="800" height="400" border="0" vspace="0"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><strong style="font-size: 14px;">[前言]</strong><br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">普通索引，也称为非唯一索引，是MySQL中最基本的索引类型。它允许在被索引的列中存在重复的值。普通索引的主要目的是加速查询速度，通过创建索引可以让数据库系统不再需要全表扫描，而是直接跳到满足条件的记录。<span style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-weight: bolder; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 14px;">[安装]</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">1、基于某项目生产环境数据库，现有三张表，表结构和记录总数如下</span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689986836686045.png" title="1689986836686045.png" alt="2.png"/><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689987013106710.png" title="1689987013106710.png" alt="3.png"/><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689987164258992.png" title="1689987164258992.png" alt="4.png"/></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">2、现有sql语句，查出某个校区所有通知(notice)的推送数量(templateLog)和已读数量(notice_read_record)<br/></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689987447143853.png" title="1689987447143853.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 08.57.15.png"/><span style="font-family: AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-45-Light; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">3、没有添加索引之前，查询结果和时间如下，mysql自动选择了<span style="font-size: 14px; text-wrap: wrap;">推送数量表templateLog.notice字段作为主键索引，运行时间：245ms</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2em;"><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689987673752026.png" title="1689987673752026.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 09.00.16.png"/><img class="rounded" src="/upload/20230722/1689987682947188.png" title="1689987682947188.png" alt="截屏2023-07-22 08.59.47.png"/></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI