c，点击安装</code>\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/221/20231203120530.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/221/20231203120530.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6666CC;">\n<p><code>2、使用快捷键command shift p，输入ftp关键字，选择ftp-sync:init，配置示例文件如下：</code>\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/221/20231203121117.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/221/20231203121117.png" /></a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/221/20231203121455.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/221/20231203121455.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6666CC;">\n<p><code>3、随便修改项目包文件，ctrl s保存，左下角有上传成功提示</code>\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/221/20231203121856.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/221/20231203121856.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[下载]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#CC0099;">\n<b id="conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies">下载链接</b>\n<p><code>本站不直接提供下载，所有下载链接均为第三方</code></p>\n<p><a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/" target="_blank">下载地址</a>\n</div>','使用vs code配置ftp-sync上传到服务器，省去在测试环境调试代码，多次上传的重复操作','vscode,ftp,code,soft','dev','0','','1',942,NULL),(222,NULL,NULL,'抓包精灵·抓取所有访问url','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/222/20231203130824.jpg" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/222/20231203130824.jpg" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>使用<code>抓包精灵</code>，抓取安卓软件或者整个安卓系统，所有访问url，以供测试和分析\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[环境]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>Android All</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[安装]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border