out-warning" style="border-left-color:#6666DD;">\n<p><code>SONY A6400<p>SONY E50 F1.8</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[视频]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<iframe height="300" width="100%" src="https://player.youku.com/embed/XNjM2NDA1MDU3Ng==" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""></iframe>\n<p>','2023整年，往返于上海市和安徽省天长市之间，利用sony a6400和dji mini 2记录两座城市的点滴','sony,天长市,上海,dji','photo','0','','1',723,NULL),(229,NULL,NULL,'Mac安装Parallels Desktop 19破解版','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/229/20240627525160.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/229/20240627525160.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>Parallels Desktop 19</code>，更快、更强、更高性能的Mac虚拟机软件\n充分利用您的 Mac，增强macOS兼容性，提供更丰富的体验。重新设计的共享打印，Windows 应用程序可以通过互联网打印协议 (IPP)进行打印。\n通过 Touch ID 集成实现无密码登录 Windows 虚拟机。重新设计应用程序图标和更新了用户界面，带来焕然一新的外观和视觉。\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[环境]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>macOS 12.0 and later</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[安装]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6666CC;">\n<p>1、双击<code>ParallelsDesktop-19.0.0-54570.dmg</code>安装\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/229/20240627053673.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/229/20240627053673.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6666CC;">\n<p>2、双击<code>Parallels Desktop Activation Tool.app</code>激活补丁，激活Parallels Desktop 19\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/229/20240627413579.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/229/20240627413579.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6666CC;">\n<p>3、<code>修改/etc/hosts文件</code>，屏蔽与parallel网站通讯，屏蔽后可能parallel网站访问不了\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>\n1. Mount the image of Parallels Desktop B