更新，搭载m4芯片，屏幕更新了纳米涂层，解决反光问题，摄像头增加了俯视功能，右侧添加了一个雷电四接口，搭载m4 pro/max芯片的机器，则更新为雷电五接口','apple,mac,m chip,pc','microchip','0','','1',836,NULL),(298,NULL,NULL,'apple m4芯片mac mini扩容','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/298/20241114427711.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/298/20241114427711.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>新款m4<code>macbook mini</code>，硬盘集成在小板上面，小板可能有加密，所以扩容只能更换小板两面的硬盘物料\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[过程]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>1、扩容过程主要分为拆解、更换硬盘物料、刷机，首先拆开底部wifi和固定风扇\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/298/20241114968916.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/298/20241114968916.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>2、更换硬盘物料，植锡等操作\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/298/20241114001451.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/298/20241114001451.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>3、利用另一台电脑连接此mac，进入dfu模式，恢复系统\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/298/20241114343440.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/298/20241114343440.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[视频]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<iframe height="300" width="100%" src="//player.bilibili.com/player.html?isOutside=true&aid=113457684811619&bvid=BV1cgmBYqEn1&cid=26697468879&p=1" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="true"></iframe>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[下载]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#CC0099;">\n<b id="conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies">下载链接</b>\n<p><code>本站不直接提供下载，所有下载链接均为第三方</code></p>\n<p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vK411V7UL" target="_blank">mac dfu恢复系统</a>\n</div>','新款m4 macbook mini，硬盘集成在小板上面，小板可能有加密，所以扩容只能更换小板两面的硬盘物料','apple,mac,m chip,pc','microchip','0','','1',1242,NULL),(299,NULL,NULL,'免费的python小游戏','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/299/20241114116896.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/299/20241114116896.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>分享一些<code>python</code>图形化小游戏，在于学习python对于gui图形化开发的理解\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[环境]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>python 3.6-3.10</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[过程]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>1、使用pip命令安装freegames游戏包\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>python3 -m pip install freegames</pre>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>2、使用list命令，展开游戏列表\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>python3 -m freegames list</pre>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/299/20241114816555.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/299/20241114816555.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>3、输入开始游戏命令，会弹出图形化界面，下面以贪吃蛇为例，利用键盘方向键控制游戏\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>python3 -m freegames.snake</pre>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/299/20241114352436.gif" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/299/20241114352436.gif" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[下载]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#CC0099;">\n<b id="conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies">下载链接</b>\n<p><code>本站不直接提供下载，所有下载链接均为第三方</code></p>\n<p><a href="https://github.com/grantjenks/free-python-games" target="_blank">github/free-python-games</a>\n</div>','分享一些python图形化小游戏，在于学习python对于gui图形化开发的理解','mac,python,windows,code','dev','0','','1',848,NULL),(302,NULL,NULL,'mac使用brew安装php8','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/302/20241130304185.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/302/20241130304185.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>使用brew安装php8，并打印<code>phpinfo()</code>信息\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[环境]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>macos 13 or later</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[过程]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>1、brew只支持macos最新的<code>三个版本</code>，所以安装php8，建议升级到<code>macos13以上</code>\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/302/20241130805442.jpg" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/302/20241130805442.jpg" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>2、使用brew命令，安装php8\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>brew install php@8.3</pre>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/302/20241130147878.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/302/20241130147878.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>3、新建<code>index.php</code>文件，打印php版本信息\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>print_r(phpinfo());</pre>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/302/20241130317945.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/302/20241130317945.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[下载]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#CC0099;">\n<b id="conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies">下载链接</b>\n<p><code>本站不直接提供下载，所有下载链接均为第三方</code></p>\n<p><a href="https://www.php.net/releases/8.4/zh.php" target="_blank">php8特性</a>\n</div>','使用brew安装php8，并打印phpinfo()信息','mac,php,homebrew,code','dev','0','','1',880,NULL),(303,NULL,NULL,'m芯片安装microsoft office 2024破解版','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/303/20241204113361.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/303/20241204113361.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>在<code>m芯片</code>安装原版<code>microsoft office 2024</code>，并且使用破解文件进行破解，适配<code>m1/m2/m3芯片</code>的mac\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[环境]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>macos 13 or later</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[过程]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>1、下载<code>Microsoft Office LTSC 2021 / LTSC 2024 / Office 365 </code>套件安装程序，这是原版安装文件，安装过程可以联网\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/303/20241204529708.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/303/20241204529708.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>2、首次打开，会显示<code>只读模式</code>，无法跳过登录，需要安装破解文件进行破解\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/303/20241204376682.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/303/20241204376682.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>3、下载<code>破解文件</code>安装，安装结束再次打开office，会自动显示<code>跳过登录</code>，打开<code>活动监视器</code>，会显示已经是<code>apple原生应用</code>\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/303/20241204111501.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/303/20241204111501.png" /></a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/303/20241204917660.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/303/20241204917660.png" /></a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/303/20241204680104.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/303/20241204680104.png" /></a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/303/20241204789681.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/303/20241204789681.png" /></a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<b>[下载]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#CC0099;">\n<b id="conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies">下载链接</b>\n<p><code>本站不直接提供下载，所有下载链接均为第三方</code></p>\n<p><a href="https://github.com/alsyundawy/Microsoft-Office-For-MacOS?tab=readme-ov-file#microsoft-office-for-mac-installer" target="_blank">microsoft office 2024安装/破解</a>\n</div>','在m芯片安装原版microsoft office 2024，并且使用破解文件进行破解，适配m1/m2/m3芯片的mac','mac,microsoft,office,arm','soft','0','','1',4942,NULL),(306,NULL,NULL,'ubuntu安装mysql8.x以及配置','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/306/20241206177476.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/306/20241206177476.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>在<code>ubuntu</code>服务器安装<code>mysql8.x</code>，并且设置root密码，开启远程访问，放开3306端口，彻底卸载mysl等操作\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[环境]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>ubuntu 24 for arm</code>\n<p><code>mysql8.0</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[过程]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>1、输入命令行，安装默认版本<code>mysql8.0</code>\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>sudo apt install mysql-server</pre>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>2、首次打开，会显示<code>无密码</code>进入，默认已启动，如未启动，输入命令行，设置启动并加入开机启动项\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>\n# mysql-server 服务名称就是mysql\nsystemctl start mysql\n# 设置开机自启动\nsystemctl enable mysql\n</pre>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/306/20241206422082.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/306/20241206422082.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>3、修改root密码，开启远程访问，首次输入mysql命令，即可无密码进入，注意默认root账户plugin是<code>auth_socket</code>，使用sql修改为<code>caching_sha2_password</code>，即密码验证\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>\n# 首次无密码进入\nmysql\n# 使用mysql系统表\nuse mysql;\n# 查询所有用户和权限\nselect user,host,plugin from user;\n# 设置root为任意远程主机连接，仅在测试环境建议使用\nGRANT all  PRIVILEGES  ON *.* to \'root\'@\'%\' with GRANT  OPTION;\n# 修改root为caching_sha2_password，即密码验证\nALTER user \'root\'@\'%\'  IDENTIFIED WITH caching_sha2_password BY \'2024@@!!Hu\';\n# 刷新权限，即刻生效\nFLUSH PRIVILEGES;\n ------------------ ----------- ----------------------- \n| user             | host      | plugin                |\n ------------------ ----------- ----------------------- \n| root             | %         | caching_sha2_password |\n| debian-sys-maint | localhost | caching_sha2_password |\n| mysql.infoschema | localhost | caching_sha2_password |\n| mysql.session    | localhost | caching_sha2_password |\n| mysql.sys        | localhost | caching_sha2_password |\n ------------------ ----------- ----------------------- \n5 rows in set (0.00 sec)\n</pre>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>4、修改mysql配置文件，将<code>bind-address</code>注释掉或者修改为<code>0.0.0.0</code>，配置文件路径在<code>/etc/mysql/mysql.conf.d/mysqld.cnf</code>\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/306/20241206871434.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/306/20241206871434.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>5、打开防火墙，放开<code>3306</code>端口\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>\n# 查看所有允许的端口\nufw status\n\nStatus: active\n\nTo                         Action      From\n--                         ------      ----\n80                         ALLOW       Anywhere                  \n22                         ALLOW       Anywhere                  \n3306                       ALLOW       Anywhere                  \n80 (v6)                    ALLOW       Anywhere (v6)             \n22 (v6)                    ALLOW       Anywhere (v6)             \n3306 (v6)                  ALLOW       Anywhere (v6) \n\n# 放开3306端口\nufw allow 3306\n\nRule added\nRule added (v6)\n</pre>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>6、彻底卸载<code>mysql</code>，并且删除<code>mysql</code>配置文件夹\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>\n# 自动卸载mysql（包括server和client）\nsudo apt-get autoremove mysql* --purge\nsudo apt-get remove apparmor\n# 删除mysql的数据文件\nsudo rm /var/lib/mysql/ -R\n# 删除mysql的配置文件\nsudo rm /etc/mysql/ -R\n</pre>\n<p>\n\n\n<p>\n<b>[下载]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#CC0099;">\n<b id="conveying-meaning-to-assistive-technologies">下载链接</b>\n<p><code>本站不直接提供下载，所有下载链接均为第三方</code></p>\n<p><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/qq_42899641/article/details/138657528" target="_blank">Ubuntu安装Mysql数据库无法远程连接</a>\n<p><a href="https://developer.aliyun.com/article/979248" target="_blank">Ubuntu彻底卸载MySQL</a>\n</div>','在ubuntu服务器安装mysql8.x，并且设置root密码，开启远程访问，放开3306端口，彻底卸载mysl等操作','mysql,arm,ubuntu,linux','dev','0','','1',688,NULL),(309,NULL,NULL,'docker操作镜像','','','','','了解docker镜像基本原理，基于docker镜像库的增删改查','docker,nginx,image,linux','dev','0','/docs/docker/#/?id=操作镜像','1',17,NULL),(310,NULL,NULL,'docker操作容器','','','','','了解docker容器基本原理，对于docker容器启动、查看、删除、重启、拷贝文件等操作','docker,nginx,container,linux','dev','0','/docs/docker/#/?id=操作容器','1',16,NULL),(311,NULL,NULL,'docker基本原理','','','','','了解docker镜像基本原理，介绍docker容器的组成部分等内容','docker,images,container,linux','dev','0','/docs/docker/#/?id=docker文档','1',0,NULL),(312,NULL,'2026-03-11 20:12:49','docker部署lnmp-web环境','','','','','在docker部署web开发环境，常见的linux/nginx/mysql/php环境','docker,nginx,php,mysql','dev','0','/docs/docker/#/?id=lnmp-x86镜像','1',0,NULL),(313,NULL,NULL,'mac部署deepseek并使用','','','','<p>\n<a href="/upload/313/6203923de4ee163e.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/313/6203923de4ee163e.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[前言]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>使用ollama部署ai 大模型deepseek r1，可选使用chrome插件page assist桌面ui实现ai对话\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[环境]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p><code>macos 14.6</code>\n<p><code>deepseek r1</code>\n<p><code>ollama</code>\n<p><code>chrome(page assist)</code>\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<b>[过程]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>1、在网页下载ollama并安装，Ollama 是一个开源框架，专为在本地机器上便捷部署和运行大型语言模型（LLM）而设计\n</div><p>\n\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/313/b26e9eae0c6e23b2.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/313/b26e9eae0c6e23b2.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>2、在终端使用ollama安装命令，安装deepseek r1大模型\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<pre>\nollama run deepseek-r1\n</pre>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/313/f65937e0fb39dd44.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/313/f65937e0fb39dd44.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>3、打开谷歌浏览器，打开扩展商店，安装page assist插件，page assist是一个和ai大模型对话的web ui\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/313/474653cb918ef0e0.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/313/474653cb918ef0e0.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>4、打开page assist，选择deepseek r1 模型\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/313/11a58c4b1f5cd01d.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/313/11a58c4b1f5cd01d.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning" style="border-left-color:#6699FF;">\n<p>5、尝试和deepseek r1对话，可以在对话框打开网络搜索选项，结果会更加准确\n</div><p>\n<p>\n<a href="/upload/313/32b9298eb321b590.png" data-fancybox="gallery" data-caption=""><img class="rounded" src="/upload/313/32b9298eb321b590.png" /></a>\n<p>\n\n\n<p>\n<b>[下载]</b>\n<hr></hr>\n<p>\n\n<div class="bd-callout bd-callout-warning"